From aa580590cedd6ec2de68b2fe4e57c72069806706 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/18] Add moving platforms and Room 3 layout data

MovingPlatform.ts: motion is a pure function of time (eased, with pauses and a phase
offset), plus rider carrying and push-out so a platform sliding into the player cannot
teleport them on top. LevelData gets Room 3 'The Drifting Gallery': two sideways stones
(one dark, lantern-only), a rest stop, and a lift. Goal moves to G3; G2 becomes a checkpoint.
24 new tests.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
